  "description": "「Aha! More Photo Spot-the-Difference」 is a spot-the-difference game featuring the \"Aha! moment\" experience, where part of a photo gradually changes over time.\n\nAt first, the photo looks completely ordinary.\nBut stare a little longer, and—\n「Huh? Something changed!」\nIn that instant, your brain lights up with a satisfying jolt.\n\nNo complicated controls needed.\nJust use your instincts to spot the difference —\nperfect for a quick brain workout or a mental reset on the go.\n\n・The moment you notice the change becomes addictive\n・A satisfying tempo that lets you play in short bursts\n・Simple rules the whole family can enjoy\n\n「Just one more round」 — you won't be able to stop.\nExperience this photo spot-the-difference game that sharpens your powers of observation and awareness.\n\n———————————————\nTT supports gameplay streamers.\nNo permission from TT is required for gameplay streaming, whether personal or commercial.",
